{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-persona#card-zh","repo":"Diluka/dsh-persona","commit":"aa2ddb01de25ce203bf25272a1cc26fc459b3d31","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-persona 是面向 DSH Web 的沟通风格插件，会在每次模型请求的系统提示词中加入独立的风格段落，并提供网页设置页管理风格。用户可以在友好协作和务实直接两种只读内置风格间切换，查看当前风格提示词，编辑所有风格共用的提示词，并重置共通内容为继承默认值。设置保存在 DSH profile 的插件配置中，修改后用于后续请求。适合希望调整编码助手表达方式、同时保留通用协作指导的 DSH Web 用户；需要安装到 DSH Web profile，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-56","lib/client.js:600-669","lib/persona.js:7-18"]}
{"unit_id":"Diluka__dsh-persona#card-en","repo":"Diluka/dsh-persona","commit":"aa2ddb01de25ce203bf25272a1cc26fc459b3d31","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-persona adds a style section to DSH Web model prompts and a profile-backed settings page. Choose Friendly or Pragmatic, preview its read-only prompt, and edit shared guidance used with either style. Changes apply to later requests. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-56","lib/client.js:600-669","lib/persona.js:7-18"]}
